  { w: 'recite', p: '/rɪˈsaɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '背诵；朗诵；列举', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Our teacher has us recite ten classical poems every single week.', exZh: '老师要求我们每周背诵十首古诗。' },
  { w: 'consolidate', p: '/kənˈsɑːlɪdeɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '巩固；加强；合并', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Doing a short exercise after class helps consolidate what you learned.', exZh: '课后做一点小练习，有助于巩固当天所学。' },
  { w: 'revise', p: '/rɪˈvaɪz/', pos: 'v.', zh: '复习；修改，修订', deck: 'senior', ex: 'You should revise your essay several times before turning it in.', exZh: '在交作文之前，你应当把文章修改好几遍。' },
  { w: 'preview', p: '/ˈpriːvjuː/', pos: 'v. / n.', zh: '预习；预告', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Our teacher asks us to preview the text before every class.', exZh: '老师要求我们每节课前先预习课文。' },
  { w: 'outline', p: '/ˈaʊtlaɪn/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '提纲；梗概；概述要点', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Draw up a simple outline before you start writing your composition.', exZh: '开始写作文之前，先列一个简单提纲。' },
  { w: 'summary', p: '/ˈsʌməri/', pos: 'n.', zh: '摘要；概要', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Try to write a short summary after reading each chapter.', exZh: '读完每一章后，试着写一段简短的摘要。' },
  { w: 'distract', p: '/dɪˈstrækt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '使分心；分散（注意力）', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Loud music in the classroom can distract students from their study.', exZh: '教室里大声的音乐会使学生无法专心学习。' },
  { w: 'discipline', p: '/ˈdɪsəplɪn/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '纪律；自律；学科；管教', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Self-discipline matters more than talent when you prepare for a long exam.', exZh: '备战一场漫长的考试时，自律比天赋更重要。' },
  { w: 'diligence', p: '/ˈdɪlɪdʒəns/', pos: 'n.', zh: '勤奋；勤勉', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Her diligence paid off when she entered her dream university.', exZh: '她考入理想的大学，勤奋终于有了回报。' },
  { w: 'repetition', p: '/ˌriːpəˈtɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '重复；反复；赘述', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Repetition may feel boring, but it is exactly how memory works.', exZh: '重复或许枯燥，但这恰恰是记忆起作用的方式。' },
  { w: 'deadline', p: '/ˈdedlaɪn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '截止日期；最后期限', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The library extended the deadline for the reading report by a week.', exZh: '图书馆把读书报告的提交期限延长了一周。' },
  { w: 'postpone', p: '/poʊˈspoʊn/', pos: 'v.', zh: '推迟；延期', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The heavy rain forced our school to postpone the sports meeting.', exZh: '大雨迫使我们学校推迟了运动会。' },
  { w: 'effective', p: '/ɪˈfektɪv/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '有效的；产生实效的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Taking small notes is an effective way to remember what you read.', exZh: '随手做笔记是记住阅读内容的有效方法。' },
  { w: 'retain', p: '/rɪˈteɪn/', pos: 'v.', zh: '记住；保留；保持', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Students retain information better when they teach it to someone else.', exZh: '把知识讲给别人听时，学生记得更牢。' },
  { w: 'focus', p: '/ˈfoʊkəs/', pos: 'v. / n.', zh: '集中；专注；焦点', deck: 'senior', ex: 'It is hard to focus on homework with a phone nearby.', exZh: '手机放在旁边时，很难专心写作业。' },
  { w: 'immerse', p: '/ɪˈmɜːrs/', pos: 'v.', zh: '使沉浸；使专心于', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The best way to learn a language is to immerse yourself in it.', exZh: '学习一门语言最好的办法，就是让自己沉浸在它当中。' },
  { w: 'digest', p: '/daɪˈdʒest/', pos: 'v.', zh: '消化；理解，吸收', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Give your brain time to digest a difficult passage before rereading it.', exZh: '重读难懂的文段之前，先给大脑一点消化的时间。' },

  { w: 'obstacle', p: '/ˈɑːbstəkl/', pos: 'n.', zh: '障碍；阻碍', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Lack of confidence is often the biggest obstacle to learning English.', exZh: '缺乏自信往往是学英语最大的障碍。' },
  { w: 'setback', p: '/ˈsetbæk/', pos: 'n.', zh: '挫折；倒退', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Failing the first mock exam was a setback, but she refused to quit.', exZh: '第一次模拟考失利是个挫折，但她拒绝放弃。' },
  { w: 'perseverance', p: '/ˌpɜːrsəˈvɪrəns/', pos: 'n.', zh: '毅力；坚持不懈', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Years of perseverance turned the shy village boy into a fine pianist.', exZh: '多年的坚持让这个害羞的乡村男孩成长为出色的钢琴手。' },
  { w: 'frustration', p: '/ˌfrʌˈstreɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '挫败；沮丧；挫折', deck: 'senior', ex: 'He swallowed his frustration and tried the puzzle once more.', exZh: '他压下心中的沮丧，又把那道题试了一遍。' },
  { w: 'endure', p: '/ɪnˈdʊr/', pos: 'v.', zh: '忍受；持续', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Top athletes learn to endure pain without losing their concentration.', exZh: '顶尖运动员学会在忍受疼痛的同时不失专注。' },
  { w: 'adversity', p: '/ədˈvɜːrsəti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '逆境；不幸', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Facing adversity, the young team chose to work harder rather than complain.', exZh: '面对逆境，这支年轻的队伍选择更努力地拼，而不是抱怨。' },
  { w: 'determination', p: '/dɪˌtɜːrmɪˈneɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '决心；果断', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Her determination to study medicine carried her through three difficult years.', exZh: '学医的决心支撑她走过了艰难的三年。' },
  { w: 'strive', p: '/straɪv/', pos: 'v.', zh: '努力；奋斗；力争', deck: 'senior', ex: 'We should strive to improve a little every day instead of seeking quick results.', exZh: '我们应力争每天进步一点，而不是急于求成。' },
  { w: 'persist', p: '/pərˈsɪst/', pos: 'v.', zh: '坚持；持续存在', deck: 'senior', ex: 'If you persist in practicing speaking, your confidence will grow steadily.', exZh: '如果你坚持练习口语，自信心会稳步增强。' },
  { w: 'achievement', p: '/əˈtʃiːvmənt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '成就；达成；成绩', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Finishing the marathon was his greatest personal achievement so far.', exZh: '跑完马拉松是他迄今为止最大的个人成就。' },
  { w: 'persevere', p: '/ˌpɜːrsəˈvɪr/', pos: 'v.', zh: '坚持不懈；锲而不舍', deck: 'senior', ex: 'She persevered through dozens of rejections before finally getting an offer.', exZh: '她经历了数十次拒绝仍不放弃，最终收到了录用通知。' },
  { w: 'yield', p: '/jiːld/', pos: 'v.', zh: '出产；让路；屈服', deck: 'senior', ex: 'New techniques have helped the quiet village yield more rice each autumn.', exZh: '新技术帮助这个安静的村庄每年秋天产出更多水稻。' },
  { w: 'pressure', p: '/ˈpreʃər/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '压力；压迫；逼迫', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Parents sometimes put too much pressure on children during exam season.', exZh: '考试季，父母有时会给孩子太大压力。' },
  { w: 'burden', p: '/ˈbɜːrdn/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '负担；使负重荷', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Sharing the housework keeps it from becoming a burden on one person.', exZh: '分担家务能避免它变成压在一个人身上的负担。' },
  { w: 'motivate', p: '/ˈmoʊtɪveɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '激励；激发……的积极性', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A good teacher knows how to motivate students who are losing interest.', exZh: '好老师懂得如何激励那些正在失去兴趣的学生。' },
  { w: 'nevertheless', p: '/ˌnevərðəˈles/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '然而；不过；尽管如此', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The task was extremely hard; nevertheless, nobody in the group gave up.', exZh: '任务极难，但小组里没有人因此放弃。' },
  { w: 'regardless', p: '/rɪˈɡɑːrdlɪs/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '无论如何；不管怎样', deck: 'senior', ex: 'She keeps running every single morning regardless of how cold it is.', exZh: '不管多冷，她坚持每天早晨都去跑步。' },

  { w: 'anxiety', p: '/æŋˈzaɪəti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '焦虑；忧虑', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Writing down worries before bed often reduces anxiety and improves sleep.', exZh: '睡前把烦恼写下来，常常能减轻焦虑、改善睡眠。' },
  { w: 'relief', p: '/rɪˈliːf/', pos: 'n.', zh: '宽慰；缓解；救济', deck: 'senior', ex: 'To his relief, the teacher announced that the test would wait until Monday.', exZh: '让他宽慰的是，老师宣布测验推迟到周一。' },
  { w: 'jealous', p: '/ˈdʒeləs/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '嫉妒的；羡慕的；猜疑的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'He grew jealous when his classmate won the prize rather than him.', exZh: '同学而不是他得奖时，他心里嫉妒起来。' },
  { w: 'content', p: '/kənˈtent/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '满足的；甘愿的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Many young people today are content with watching short videos all evening.', exZh: '如今很多年轻人整个晚上看短视频就心满意足。' },
  { w: 'optimistic', p: '/ˌɑːptɪˈmɪstɪk/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '乐观的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'She stayed optimistic even after failing the same experiment three times.', exZh: '即使同一个实验失败三次，她依然保持乐观。' },
  { w: 'pessimistic', p: '/ˌpesɪˈmɪstɪk/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '悲观的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Do not be pessimistic, because one bad grade does not decide your future.', exZh: '别悲观，一次成绩不好并不能决定你的未来。' },
  { w: 'enthusiastic', p: '/ɪnˌθuːziˈæstɪk/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '热情的；热心的；热衷的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The audience became enthusiastic as the young violinist played the final piece.', exZh: '年轻小提琴手奏响最后一个乐章时，观众情绪高涨起来。' },
  { w: 'ashamed', p: '/əˈʃeɪmd/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '羞愧的；惭愧的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'He was ashamed of lying to the coach about his injured ankle.', exZh: '他为自己向教练谎报脚踝受伤而感到羞愧。' },
  { w: 'guilty', p: '/ˈɡɪlti/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '内疚的；有罪的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'She felt guilty about spending so little time with her grandparents.', exZh: '陪祖父母的时间太少，她心里很内疚。' },
  { w: 'desperate', p: '/ˈdespərət/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '极需要的；绝望的；不顾一切的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The farmer was desperate for rain after months without a single drop.', exZh: '几个月滴雨未下，农民急切地盼着降雨。' },
  { w: 'eager', p: '/ˈiːɡər/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '渴望的；热切的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The exchange students are eager to try making dumplings with their own hands.', exZh: '交换生们渴望亲手试试包饺子。' },
  { w: 'keen', p: '/kiːn/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '热衷的；敏锐的；锋利的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'My brother is keen on astronomy and reads about stars every night.', exZh: '我弟弟痴迷天文，每晚都读关于星星的书。' },
  { w: 'panic', p: '/ˈpænɪk/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '恐慌；惊慌', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Do not panic if you meet a word you have never seen before.', exZh: '遇到从没见过的单词时，不要慌。' },
  { w: 'resilience', p: '/rɪˈzɪliəns/', pos: 'n.', zh: '韧性；恢复力；抗压能力', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Sports teach children resilience by showing them how to lose well.', exZh: '体育通过教会孩子如何体面地输来培养他们的韧性。' },
  { w: 'temper', p: '/ˈtempər/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '脾气；缓和；调和', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Learning to control your temper makes family disagreements much easier to settle.', exZh: '学会控制脾气，家庭分歧就容易解决得多。' },
  { w: 'passion', p: '/ˈpæʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '激情；热爱；强烈情感', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Her passion for painting grew stronger during the long summer holiday.', exZh: '漫长的暑假里，她对绘画的热爱愈发强烈。' },
  { w: 'annoyed', p: '/əˈnɔɪd/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '恼火的；生气的；被惹烦的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The neighbours were annoyed by the noise from the late night market.', exZh: '夜市深夜的喧闹声让邻居们很恼火。' },

  { w: 'prioritize', p: '/praɪˈɔːrətaɪz/', pos: 'v.', zh: '优先处理；按重要性排序', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Busy students must learn to prioritize the tasks that matter most.', exZh: '学业繁忙的学生必须学会优先处理最重要的任务。' },
  { w: 'leisure', p: '/ˈliːʒər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '闲暇；空闲时间', deck: 'senior', ex: 'In his leisure time, the retired engineer repairs bicycles for neighbours.', exZh: '空闲时间里，这位退休工程师帮邻居修自行车。' },
  { w: 'moderate', p: '/ˈmɑːdərət/', pos: 'adj. / v.', zh: '适度的；温和的；缓和', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Moderate exercise every day does more good than one long workout.', exZh: '每天适度锻炼，比一次长时间剧烈运动更有益。' },
  { w: 'appetite', p: '/ˈæpɪtaɪt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '食欲；胃口；欲望', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Children who play outside often show a healthier appetite at dinner.', exZh: '常在户外玩耍的孩子，晚饭时往往食欲更好。' },
  { w: 'nutrition', p: '/nuˈtrɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '营养；营养学', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Better nutrition at school helps teenagers grow taller and think clearly.', exZh: '学校里更好的营养条件有助于青少年长个儿、思路清晰。' },
  { w: 'fitness', p: '/ˈfɪtnəs/', pos: 'n.', zh: '健康；体能；适应', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The app records daily fitness data and gently reminds users to move.', exZh: '这款应用记录每天的健身数据，并轻轻提醒用户起身活动。' },
  { w: 'addicted', p: '/əˈdɪktɪd/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '上瘾的；沉溺的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Some teenagers have become addicted to short videos on their phones.', exZh: '一些青少年已经沉迷于手机上的短视频。' },
  { w: 'posture', p: '/ˈpɑːstʃər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '姿势；姿态', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Sitting with a straight back improves your posture during long study.', exZh: '挺直腰背坐着，能改善长时间学习时的坐姿。' },
  { w: 'calorie', p: '/ˈkæləri/', pos: 'n.', zh: '卡路里；热量', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Walking to school instead of riding burns extra calories every single day.', exZh: '步行上学而非乘车，每天都能额外消耗热量。' },
  { w: 'symptom', p: '/ˈsɪmptəm/', pos: 'n.', zh: '症状；征兆', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A sore throat can be a symptom of tiredness and dry classroom air.', exZh: '喉咙痛可能是疲劳和教室空气干燥的征兆。' },
  { w: 'strengthen', p: '/ˈstreŋθn/', pos: 'v.', zh: '加强；巩固；使强壮', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Simple daily exercises can strengthen the backs of students who sit for hours.', exZh: '简单的每日锻炼能增强久坐学生腰背的力量。' },
  { w: 'sedentary', p: '/ˈsednteri/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '久坐的；蹲坐不动的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A sedentary lifestyle is now a serious risk for tired office workers.', exZh: '久坐不动的生活方式如今是疲惫上班族的严重隐患。' },
  { w: 'refresh', p: '/rɪˈfreʃ/', pos: 'v.', zh: '使恢复精力；更新；刷新', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A short nap in the afternoon can refresh a student for the evening study.', exZh: '午后小睡片刻，能让学生晚上的学习重新有了精神。' },
  { w: 'vaccine', p: '/vækˈsiːn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '疫苗', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The vaccine helped the small town control the spread of the disease.', exZh: '疫苗帮助这座小镇控制了疾病的传播。' },
  { w: 'avoid', p: '/əˈvɔɪd/', pos: 'v.', zh: '避免；躲开；不接触', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Doctors advise teenagers to avoid strong tea before a long exam.', exZh: '医生建议青少年在长时间考试前不要喝浓茶。' },
  { w: 'merely', p: '/ˈmɪrli/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '仅仅；只不过', deck: 'senior', ex: 'This is merely a temporary difficulty, not the end of your effort.', exZh: '这只不过是一时的困难，并不是你努力的终点。' },
  { w: 'instead', p: '/ɪnˈsted/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '反而；顶替；代替', deck: 'senior', ex: 'He watched no television and studied grammar for half an hour instead.', exZh: '他没有看电视，而是学了半小时语法。' },

  { w: 'career', p: '/kəˈrɪr/', pos: 'n.', zh: '职业；生涯', deck: 'senior', ex: 'School talks help teenagers think about their future career choices early.', exZh: '学校的讲座帮助青少年早点思考未来的职业选择。' },
  { w: 'profession', p: '/prəˈfeʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '职业；行业', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Teaching is a profession that asks for both knowledge and patience.', exZh: '教书是一种既需要学识又需要耐心的职业。' },
  { w: 'professional', p: '/prəˈfeʃənl/', pos: 'adj. / n.', zh: '专业的；职业的；专业人士', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A professional chef showed our class how to cut vegetables safely.', exZh: '一位专业厨师向全班演示了如何安全地切菜。' },
  { w: 'occupation', p: '/ˌɑːkjuˈpeɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '职业；占领；占用', deck: 'senior', ex: 'In the survey, parents named their occupation and described an ordinary working day.', exZh: '问卷调查中，父母写下自己的职业，并描述了一个平常的工作日。' },
  { w: 'interview', p: '/ˈɪntərvjuː/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '面试；采访；访谈', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The young journalist interviewed the old farmer about changes in the village.', exZh: '年轻记者就村庄的变化采访了那位老农民。' },
  { w: 'applicant', p: '/ˈæplɪkənt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '申请人', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Every applicant for the volunteering program must attend a short training session.', exZh: '志愿服务项目的每位申请人都要参加一次简短培训。' },
  { w: 'apply', p: '/əˈplaɪ/', pos: 'v.', zh: '申请；应用；涂敷', deck: 'senior', ex: 'She decided to apply for the summer camp after thinking about it twice.', exZh: '再三考虑后，她决定申请那个夏令营。' },
  { w: 'employer', p: '/ɪmˈplɔɪər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '雇主；雇佣单位', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A good employer listens to workers before changing the difficult working rules.', exZh: '好雇主会在修改苛刻的用工规定前听取工人的意见。' },
  { w: 'employee', p: '/ɪmˈplɔɪiː/', pos: 'n.', zh: '雇员；员工', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The company trains each employee to deal with angry customers politely.', exZh: '公司培训每位员工，让他们礼貌地应对愤怒的顾客。' },
  { w: 'employment', p: '/ɪmˈplɔɪmənt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '就业；雇用；工作', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Two new factories brought steady employment to families that had left the countryside.', exZh: '两家新工厂为那些已离开农村的家庭带来了稳定的工作。' },
  { w: 'salary', p: '/ˈsæləri/', pos: 'n.', zh: '薪水；工资', deck: 'senior', ex: 'He lives close to the office so that his salary is not spent on fares.', exZh: '他住得离办公室很近，这样工资就不至于花在交通费上。' },
  { w: 'income', p: '/ˈɪnkʌm/', pos: 'n.', zh: '收入；所得', deck: 'senior', ex: 'As family income rises, more villagers travel with their phones during holidays.', exZh: '随着家庭收入提高，更多村民假期出游时会带上手机。' },
  { w: 'promotion', p: '/prəˈmoʊʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '晋升；促销活动；宣传', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Her hard work on the school project led to a quick promotion.', exZh: '她在这个项目上辛勤付出，很快获得了晋升。' },
  { w: 'recruit', p: '/rɪˈkruːt/', pos: 'v. / n.', zh: '招募；吸收新成员；新成员', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The club recruits new members every September with an open afternoon event.', exZh: '俱乐部每年九月通过一场公开下午活动招募新成员。' },
  { w: 'retire', p: '/rɪˈtaɪər/', pos: 'v.', zh: '退休；退役；退出', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The teacher plans to retire next year but still arrives at school early.', exZh: '这位老师打算明年退休，但每天仍早早到校。' },
  { w: 'ambition', p: '/æmˈbɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '抱负；志向；野心', deck: 'senior', ex: 'His ambition of becoming a doctor grew out of a childhood illness.', exZh: '他当医生的志向，源于小时候的一场病。' },
  { w: 'competent', p: '/ˈkɑːmpətənt/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '有能力的；胜任的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A competent driver keeps calm when the mountain road suddenly turns icy.', exZh: '称职的司机在山路突然结冰时仍能保持冷静。' },

  { w: 'acquaintance', p: '/əˈkweɪntəns/', pos: 'n.', zh: '熟人；泛泛之交；了解', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A short nod to an old acquaintance is easier than a long conversation.', exZh: '向一位老熟人轻轻点头，比长谈一场更容易。' },
  { w: 'companion', p: '/kəmˈpæniən/', pos: 'n.', zh: '同伴；伴侣；陪伴物', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Reading became a quiet companion during his year in the countryside.', exZh: '在乡下待的那一年里，读书成了他安静的伙伴。' },
  { w: 'hospitality', p: '/ˌhɑːspɪˈtæləti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '好客；殷勤招待', deck: 'senior', ex: 'We thanked the farming family for their warm hospitality during the holiday.', exZh: '我们感谢那户农家在假期里的热情款待。' },
  { w: 'sincere', p: '/sɪnˈsɪr/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '真诚的；诚挚的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A sincere word can repair a friendship that months of silence cannot.', exZh: '一句真诚的话能修复几个月的沉默所不能修复的友谊。' },
  { w: 'compliment', p: '/ˈkɑːmplɪmənt/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '赞美；恭维；问候', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Her teacher complimented her on the way she closed the whole speech.', exZh: '老师称赞了她收尾整场演讲的方式。' },
  { w: 'selfless', p: '/ˈselfləs/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '无私的；忘我的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Ten years of selfless work by the young doctor changed the whole village.', exZh: '这位年轻医生十年无私的付出改变了整个村庄。' },
  { w: 'apology', p: '/əˈpɑːlədʒi/', pos: 'n.', zh: '道歉；歉意', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A short apology to the host family eased the awkward silence at dinner.', exZh: '向寄宿家庭简短道个歉，晚餐时尴尬的沉默便化解了。' },
  { w: 'sympathy', p: '/ˈsɪmpəθi/', pos: 'n.', zh: '同情；同情心；赞同', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Letters of sympathy arrived from schools across the province after the fire.', exZh: '火灾之后，全省多所学校寄来了慰问信。' },
  { w: 'tolerate', p: '/ˈtɑːləreɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '容忍；忍受；耐受', deck: 'senior', ex: 'In a shared dorm, students must tolerate habits that differ from their own.', exZh: '在集体宿舍里，学生必须容忍与自己不同的习惯。' },
  { w: 'colleague', p: '/ˈkɑːliːɡ/', pos: 'n.', zh: '同事；同僚', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Her colleague offered to cover the night shift without being asked twice.', exZh: '她的同事主动提出替她值夜班，不用人开口第二遍。' },
  { w: 'voluntary', p: '/ˈvɑːlənteri/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '自愿的；无偿的；志愿的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The river cleanup was voluntary, yet nearly every family in the street joined.', exZh: '清理河道是自愿参加的，但街上几乎家家都来了。' },
  { w: 'aid', p: '/eɪd/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '援助；帮助；助手', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Food aid reached the isolated village only after the mountain road was repaired.', exZh: '山区公路修通后，粮食援助才送到那个与外界隔绝的村子。' },
  { w: 'contribution', p: '/ˌkɑːntrɪˈbjuːʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '贡献；捐款；投稿', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Nobody is too young to make a real contribution to the local community.', exZh: '谁都不会因为太小而无法为社区做出真正的贡献。' },
  { w: 'community', p: '/kəˈmjuːnəti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '社区；团体；共同体', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Young volunteers rebuilt the community garden that the storm had destroyed.', exZh: '年轻志愿者重建了被风暴毁坏的小区花园。' },
  { w: 'participate', p: '/pɑːrˈtɪsɪpeɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '参加；参与', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Every student is encouraged to participate in at least one club activity.', exZh: '学校鼓励每位学生至少参加一项社团活动。' },
  { w: 'responsibility', p: '/rɪˌspɑːnsəˈbɪləti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '责任；职责', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Feeding the class pets teaches young children a real sense of responsibility.', exZh: '喂养班级宠物能让幼儿真正懂得责任感。' },
  { w: 'object', p: '/əbˈdʒekt/', pos: 'v. / n.', zh: '反对；物体；目标', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Several old residents objected to the plan to cut down the riverside trees.', exZh: '几位老居民反对砍掉江边那些树的计划。' },
  { w: 'despite', p: '/dɪˈspaɪt/', pos: 'prep.', zh: '尽管；不管', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Despite the heavy morning fog, the coach kept the training on schedule.', exZh: '尽管清晨大雾，教练仍按计划进行训练。' },

  { w: 'folk', p: '/ˈfoʊk/', pos: 'adj. / n.', zh: '民间的；民俗的；民族音乐；人们', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Local folk songs brought the ancient fair back to the mountain town.', exZh: '当地的民歌让这座山城古老的市场重新热闹起来。' },
  { w: 'convention', p: '/kənˈvenʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '惯例；习俗；大会；约定', deck: 'senior', ex: 'By convention, the oldest uncle pours the first cup of tea at dinner.', exZh: '按惯例，晚饭时由年长的伯父先斟第一杯茶。' },
  { w: 'heritage', p: '/ˈherɪtɪdʒ/', pos: 'n.', zh: '遗产；传统', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The old town is now listed as part of the world cultural heritage.', exZh: '这座古城现已被列为世界文化遗产的一部分。' },
  { w: 'ceremony', p: '/ˈserəmoʊni/', pos: 'n.', zh: '典礼；仪式；礼节', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The tea ceremony shows patience and respect in every small movement.', exZh: '茶道在每一个细微动作中体现耐心与敬意。' },
  { w: 'commemorate', p: '/kəˈmeməreɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '纪念；作为……的纪念', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The town held a fair to commemorate the brave rescue a century ago.', exZh: '镇上举办集市，纪念一个世纪前那次英勇的营救。' },
  { w: 'celebration', p: '/ˌselɪˈbreɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '庆祝；庆典', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The harvest celebration brings back villagers who work in distant cities.', exZh: '丰收庆典把在远方城市打工的村民引了回来。' },
  { w: 'occasion', p: '/əˈkeɪʒn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '场合；时机；重大事件', deck: 'senior', ex: 'For such a special occasion, her grandmother brought out the old red cloth.', exZh: '为了这样特别的场合，奶奶取出了那块旧红布。' },
  { w: 'reunion', p: '/riˈjuːniən/', pos: 'n.', zh: '团聚；重逢；同学会', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The long family reunion dinner lasted until the little children fell asleep.', exZh: '漫长的团圆年夜饭一直吃到小孩子睡着。' },
  { w: 'symbol', p: '/ˈsɪmbl/', pos: 'n.', zh: '象征；符号；标志', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The dragon is a symbol of strength in Chinese farming tradition.', exZh: '在中国农耕传统中，龙是力量的象征。' },
  { w: 'identity', p: '/aɪˈdentəti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '身份；特性；同一性', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Old local dialects help people feel a strong sense of community identity.', exZh: '古老的方言让人们感受到强烈的群体身份认同。' },
  { w: 'diversity', p: '/daɪˈvɜːrsəti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '多样性；差异', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The exhibition celebrates the rich diversity of costumes across the country.', exZh: '这场展览礼赞全国各地服饰的丰富多样。' },
  { w: 'integrate', p: '/ˈɪntɪɡreɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '融入；整合；使结合', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The new students slowly integrated into village life through football games.', exZh: '新生通过踢球慢慢融入了村里的生活。' },
  { w: 'barrier', p: '/ˈbæriər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '障碍；屏障；隔阂', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A shared hobby can quickly break down the barrier between two strangers.', exZh: '共同的爱好能迅速打破两个陌生人之间的隔阂。' },
  { w: 'native', p: '/ˈneɪtɪv/', pos: 'adj. / n.', zh: '本地的；天然的；本地人；母语者', deck: 'senior', ex: 'My host family showed me simple dishes that every native child loves.', exZh: '寄宿家庭带我品尝了当地孩子都爱吃的家常菜。' },
  { w: 'exchange', p: '/ɪksˈtʃeɪndʒ/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '交流；交换；互访', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The student exchange between our two schools has already lasted ten years.', exZh: '我们两校之间的学生交流项目已经持续了十年。' },
  { w: 'nowadays', p: '/ˈnaʊədeɪz/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '现今；如今', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Nowadays young people watch traditional operas on their phones rather than on stage.', exZh: '如今年轻人在手机上看传统戏曲，而不再去戏台。' },
  { w: 'overseas', p: '/ˌoʊvərˈsiːz/', pos: 'adj. / adv.', zh: '海外的；国外的；在海外', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Many overseas Chinese returned home to help build the first railway.', exZh: '许多海外华侨回国帮助修建了第一条铁路。' },

  { w: 'invention', p: '/ɪnˈvenʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '发明；发明物；创造', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Papermaking was an invention that slowly changed how people kept knowledge.', exZh: '造纸术是一项逐渐改变人类保存知识方式的发明。' },
  { w: 'hardware', p: '/ˈhɑːrdwer/', pos: 'n.', zh: '硬件；金属材料；五金', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The lab ordered new hardware, yet the old programs still run fine.', exZh: '实验室订购了新硬件，但旧程序仍能正常运行。' },
  { w: 'artificial', p: '/ˌɑːrtɪˈfɪʃl/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '人造的；人工的；虚假的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Artificial lights make it hard for children here to see the real stars.', exZh: '人造光让这里的孩子很难看到真正的星星。' },
  { w: 'intelligence', p: '/ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns/', pos: 'n.', zh: '智力；智能；情报', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Computers with artificial intelligence can now grade simple exam papers by themselves.', exZh: '具备人工智能的电脑现在已能自行批改简单试卷。' },
  { w: 'algorithm', p: '/ˈælɡərɪðəm/', pos: 'n.', zh: '算法；运算法则', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The video app uses an algorithm to guess what teenagers want to watch.', exZh: '这款视频应用用一套算法来猜青少年想看什么。' },
  { w: 'automation', p: '/ˌɔːtəˈmeɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '自动化；自动控制', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Automation has changed the factory, so fewer workers now do the repeated tasks.', exZh: '自动化改变了这家工厂，如今做重复活的工人少了。' },
  { w: 'network', p: '/ˈnetwɜːrk/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '网络；联络系统；建立人脉', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A weak mountain connection still breaks the learning network every few minutes.', exZh: '山区微弱的信号仍会每隔几分钟就打断学习网络。' },
  { w: 'software', p: '/ˈsɔːftwer/', pos: 'n.', zh: '软件；软体', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The old computers need new software before the exam tests can run.', exZh: '这些旧电脑得先装新软件，考试系统才能运行。' },
  { w: 'access', p: '/ˈækses/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '获取；进入；使用权；存取', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Thousands of students gained access to free lessons through one shared screen.', exZh: '数千名学生通过一块共享屏幕获得了免费课程。' },
  { w: 'signal', p: '/ˈsɪɡnəl/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '信号；标志；发信号；表示', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The climber raised one arm as a signal that everyone was safe.', exZh: '攀登者举起一只手臂，作为所有人都安全的信号。' },
  { w: 'privacy', p: '/ˈprɪvəsi/', pos: 'n.', zh: '隐私；私密；隐私权', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Sharing photos of children online may put the privacy of a whole family at risk.', exZh: '在网上分享孩子的照片，可能让一家人的隐私陷入风险。' },
  { w: 'subscribe', p: '/səbˈskraɪb/', pos: 'v.', zh: '订阅；赞成；定期捐助', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Our school library lets students subscribe to ten foreign magazines for free.', exZh: '学校图书馆让学生免费订阅十份外文杂志。' },
  { w: 'update', p: '/ˈʌpdeɪt/', pos: 'v. / n.', zh: '更新；使了解最新情况；最新消息', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The learning app asks users to update it before the exam season begins.', exZh: '这款学习应用要求用户在考试季开始前先更新版本。' },
  { w: 'breakthrough', p: '/ˈbreɪkθruː/', pos: 'n.', zh: '突破；重大进展', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The research team made a breakthrough that may cut the cost of clean power.', exZh: '研究团队取得一项突破，或许能降低清洁电力的成本。' },
  { w: 'research', p: '/ˈriːsɜːrtʃ/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '研究；调查', deck: 'senior', ex: 'He spent two years researching how teenagers use their phones late at night.', exZh: '他花了两年研究青少年深夜如何使用手机。' },
  { w: 'replace', p: '/rɪˈpleɪs/', pos: 'v.', zh: '取代；替换；接替', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Machines will not replace teachers, but they will change what happens in class.', exZh: '机器不会取代老师，但会改变课堂上发生的一切。' },
  { w: 'respectively', p: '/rɪˈspektɪvli/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '分别地；各自地', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The two school teams finished first and third respectively after the final round.', exZh: '最后一轮结束后，两支校队分别获得第一和第三。' },
  { w: 'furthermore', p: '/ˌfɜːrðərˈmɔːr/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '此外；而且', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The learning app saves time; furthermore, it shows parents what children really practice.', exZh: '这款学习应用节省时间，此外还能让家长看到孩子到底练了什么。' },

  { w: 'commuter', p: '/kəˈmjuːtər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '通勤者；上下班的旅客', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Every commuter on this new line now waits less than six minutes.', exZh: '这条新线上每位通勤者现在等车不超过六分钟。' },
  { w: 'infrastructure', p: '/ˈɪnfrəstrʌktʃər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '基础设施；底层架构', deck: 'senior', ex: 'New road and power infrastructure has quietly attracted factories to the poor county.', exZh: '新的道路和电力基础设施悄悄把工厂吸引来了这个贫困县。' },
  { w: 'destination', p: '/ˌdestɪˈneɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '目的地；终点', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The high-speed train reached its destination exactly on time last Monday.', exZh: '上周一，这趟高铁准点抵达了目的地。' },
  { w: 'pedestrian', p: '/pəˈdestriən/', pos: 'n.', zh: '行人；步行者', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The new crossing gives pedestrians an extra twenty seconds to finish walking.', exZh: '新路口给行人多加了二十秒过街时间。' },
  { w: 'congestion', p: '/kənˈdʒestʃən/', pos: 'n.', zh: '拥挤；堵塞；充血', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The second subway line was built to ease congestion in the crowded city center.', exZh: '修建第二条地铁线是为了缓解市中心本已拥挤的堵车状况。' },
  { w: 'vehicle', p: '/ˈviːɪkl/', pos: 'n.', zh: '车辆；交通工具；传播媒介', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Only electric vehicles are now allowed to enter the narrow old street.', exZh: '现在只有电动车被允许驶入这条狭窄的老街。' },
  { w: 'district', p: '/ˈdɪstrɪkt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '地区；区域；行政区', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Each district of the city now has one public reading room open late.', exZh: '这座城市每个区现在有了一间营业到很晚的公共阅览室。' },
  { w: 'suburb', p: '/ˈsʌrbɜːrb/', pos: 'n.', zh: '郊区；城郊', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Thousands of young families moved to the suburb where the rents are lower.', exZh: '数千年轻家庭搬到了房租更低的郊区。' },
  { w: 'resident', p: '/ˈrezɪdənt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '居民；住户', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Local residents were consulted before the old tree-lined street was rebuilt last year.', exZh: '去年重建那条林荫老街之前，先征询了当地居民的意见。' },
  { w: 'population', p: '/ˌpɑːpjuˈleɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '人口；人口数量', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The population of the city grew quickly after two big factories opened.', exZh: '两家大工厂开张后，这座城市的人口迅速增长。' },
  { w: 'block', p: '/blɑːk/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '街区；一块；阻塞；阻碍', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A fallen tree blocked the only road out of the snowy mountain village.', exZh: '一棵倒下的树堵住了这座雪山村落唯一的出路。' },
  { w: 'facility', p: '/fəˈsɪləti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '设施；场所；才能', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The new sports facility stays open to students free of charge on Sundays.', exZh: '新体育中心周日向学生免费开放。' },
  { w: 'construct', p: '/kənˈstrʌkt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '建造；构筑；构建', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Workers spent two difficult years constructing a bridge over the deep valley.', exZh: '工人们花了艰难的两年，在深谷上架起一座桥。' },
  { w: 'accessible', p: '/əkˈsesəbl/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '可进入的；可使用的；易理解的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Simplified explanations make difficult science accessible to children in remote mountain schools.', exZh: '简化的讲解让偏远山村学校的孩子也能读懂艰深的科学。' },
  { w: 'literacy', p: '/ˈlɪtərəsi/', pos: 'n.', zh: '读写能力；文化；素养', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The evening program raised reading literacy among girls in the mountain county.', exZh: '夜间课堂提高了山区县女孩的阅读理解能力。' },
  { w: 'scholarship', p: '/ˈskɑːlərʃɪp/', pos: 'n.', zh: '奖学金；学问', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A full scholarship let the son of a poor farmer continue his studies.', exZh: '一项全额奖学金让一位贫苦农民的儿子得以继续学业。' },
  { w: 'rural', p: '/ˈrʊrəl/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '农村的；乡下的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'More young teachers are choosing rural schools now than five years ago.', exZh: '如今选择乡村学校的年轻教师比五年前更多。' },

  { w: 'pollute', p: '/pəˈluːt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '污染；玷污', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The factory was heavily fined after it continued to pollute the river.', exZh: '这家工厂持续污染河水后遭到重罚。' },
  { w: 'contaminate', p: '/kənˈtæmɪneɪt/', pos: 'v.', zh: '污染；弄脏；影响', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Chemicals from the farm contaminated the well that the whole village depended on.', exZh: '农场的化学品污染了全村依赖的那口井。' },
  { w: 'emission', p: '/ɪˈmɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '排放；排放物', deck: 'senior', ex: 'New rules require every city bus to cut its carbon emissions by half.', exZh: '新规定要求每辆市公交车把碳排放减半。' },
  { w: 'carbon', p: '/ˈkɑːrbən/', pos: 'n.', zh: '碳；碳元素', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Planting trees near the school is one simple way to reduce carbon in the air.', exZh: '在校园周边植树是减少空气中碳的简单办法之一。' },
  { w: 'fossil', p: '/ˈfɑːsl/', pos: 'adj. / n.', zh: '化石的；化石', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Burning fossil fuels remains the largest single cause of the warming trend.', exZh: '燃烧化石燃料仍是变暖趋势最大的单一成因。' },
  { w: 'atmosphere', p: '/ˈætməsfɪr/', pos: 'n.', zh: '大气；大气层；气氛', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Gases from cars stay in the atmosphere and slowly warm the surface of the earth.', exZh: '汽车尾气留在大气中，使地球表面缓慢升温。' },
  { w: 'extreme', p: '/ɪkˈstriːm/', pos: 'adj. / n.', zh: '极端的；极度的；极端；极端事物', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Farmers here now record extreme heat that their grandparents never saw.', exZh: '这里的农民如今记录到祖辈从未见过的极端高温。' },
  { w: 'threaten', p: '/ˈθretn/', pos: 'v.', zh: '威胁；恐吓；预示危害', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Rising sea levels threaten small islands that have existed here for centuries.', exZh: '海平面上升威胁着这些存在数百年的小岛。' },
  { w: 'threat', p: '/θret/', pos: 'n.', zh: '威胁；恐吓；凶兆', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Experts now call bright city lights a real threat to birds at night.', exZh: '专家们如今把城市强光称为对夜间鸟类的真正威胁。' },
  { w: 'conservation', p: '/ˌkɑːnsərˈveɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '保护；节约；保育', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Years of careful water conservation brought the dried-up lake back to life.', exZh: '多年细致的节水保护让干涸的湖泊重现生机。' },
  { w: 'preserve', p: '/prɪˈzɜːrv/', pos: 'v.', zh: '保护；保存；保鲜', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The village set aside a whole hill to preserve its thin old forest.', exZh: '村里划出一整座山，用来保护那片稀疏的老林。' },
  { w: 'renewable', p: '/rɪˈnuːəbl/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '可再生的；可续存的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Wind and sunlight are renewable sources that nobody can ever use up.', exZh: '风能和阳光是谁也用不完的再生资源。' },
  { w: 'recycling', p: '/riˈsaɪklɪŋ/', pos: 'n.', zh: '回收利用；再循环；回收站', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Strict recycling rules have cut the kitchen rubbish of the city by half.', exZh: '严格的回收规定已让这座城市的厨余垃圾减半。' },
  { w: 'litter', p: '/ˈlɪtər/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '垃圾；乱扔垃圾；杂乱', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Small signs asking visitors not to litter now stand at every trail corner.', exZh: '每条山路转角如今都立着提醒游客勿乱扔垃圾的小牌子。' },
  { w: 'greenhouse', p: '/ˈɡriːnhaʊs/', pos: 'n.', zh: '温室；暖房', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The farmers built a glass greenhouse to grow vegetables through the cold winter.', exZh: '农户搭起玻璃温室，好在严冬里种菜。' },
  { w: 'ecosystem', p: '/ˈiːkoʊsɪstəm/', pos: 'n.', zh: '生态系统', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Removing one small fish can quietly upset the balance of the whole lake ecosystem.', exZh: '移除一种小鱼，就可能悄悄打乱整个湖泊生态系统的平衡。' },
  { w: 'biodiversity', p: '/ˌbaɪoʊdaɪˈvɜːrsəti/', pos: 'n.', zh: '生物多样性', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Protecting the biodiversity of the wetland park helps thousands of birds survive.', exZh: '保护湿地公园的生物多样性，有助于成千上万只鸟存活。' },
  { w: 'consequently', p: '/ˈkɑːnsɪkwentli/', pos: 'adv.', zh: '因此；所以', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The river froze very early; consequently, the fishing village earned nothing that winter.', exZh: '河面封冻得极早，因此那个冬天渔村分文未收。' },

  { w: 'species', p: '/ˈspiːʃiːz/', pos: 'n.', zh: '物种；种类', deck: 'senior', ex: 'This rare species of crane returns to exactly the same lake every spring.', exZh: '这种珍稀的鹤每年春天都回到同一片湖泊。' },
  { w: 'habitat', p: '/ˈhæbɪtæt/', pos: 'n.', zh: '栖息地；产地', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Building new roads often cuts a habitat into pieces that animals cannot cross.', exZh: '修新路常把栖息地切成动物无法穿越的碎块。' },
  { w: 'creature', p: '/ˈkriːtʃər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '生物；动物；人', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Night cameras captured a shy creature that scientists had never recorded here.', exZh: '夜间相机拍到一种科学家在此从未记录过的羞怯动物。' },
  { w: 'extinct', p: '/ɪkˈstɪŋkt/', pos: 'adj.', zh: '灭绝的；绝种的；消失的', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Several large birds here became extinct because people cleared every tall tree.', exZh: '这里曾有几种大鸟灭绝了，因为人们砍光了所有高树。' },
  { w: 'migration', p: '/ˌmaɪˈɡreɪʃn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '迁徙；移居；迁移', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Each autumn the migration of these small butterflies covers thousands of kilometers.', exZh: '每年秋天，这些小蝴蝶的迁徙路程达数千公里。' },
  { w: 'predator', p: '/ˈpredətər/', pos: 'n.', zh: '捕食者；食肉动物；剥削者', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Losing one large predator can let field mice multiply beyond control.', exZh: '失去一种大型天敌，可能让田鼠数量失控繁殖。' },
  { w: 'prey', p: '/preɪ/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '猎物；捕食；掠夺对象', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Rabbits are the main prey of hawks that hunt above these dry hills.', exZh: '兔子是在这些干燥山丘上空盘旋的鹰的主要猎物。' },
  { w: 'reserve', p: '/rɪˈzɜːrv/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '自然保护区；保留；预订；储备', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The government declared the wetland a nature reserve for birds in winter.', exZh: '政府把这片湿地划为鸟类越冬的自然保护区。' },
  { w: 'mineral', p: '/ˈmɪnərəl/', pos: 'n.', zh: '矿物；矿物质；无机盐', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Digging for minerals can leave a green hill completely bare for many years.', exZh: '开采矿物可能让一座青山荒芜多年。' },
  { w: 'power', p: '/ˈpaʊər/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '电力；能力；权力；力量', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A sudden winter storm cut the power to three villages for two days.', exZh: '一场突如其来的冬季暴风雪让三个村庄停电两天。' },
  { w: 'shortage', p: '/ˈʃɔːrtɪdʒ/', pos: 'n.', zh: '短缺；不足', deck: 'senior', ex: 'A serious water shortage forced the dry town to collect and reuse rain water.', exZh: '严重的缺水迫使这座干旱小城收集并回用雨水。' },
  { w: 'hurricane', p: '/ˈhɜːrɪkeɪn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '飓风；暴风雪', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The hurricane tore the roof off, yet the shelter kept everyone alive.', exZh: '飓风掀掉了屋顶，但避难所让所有人都活了下来。' },
  { w: 'famine', p: '/ˈfæmɪn/', pos: 'n.', zh: '饥荒；饥馑', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The new rice variety helped the region escape its worst famine in years.', exZh: '这种新水稻帮助该地区摆脱了多年来最严重的饥荒。' },
  { w: 'rescue', p: '/ˈreskjuː/', pos: 'n. / v.', zh: '营救；救援；解救', deck: 'senior', ex: 'The rescue team worked through the night to reach the trapped miners.', exZh: '救援队通宵作业，赶到被困矿工身边。' },
  { w: 'volcano', p: '/vɑːlˈkeɪnoʊ/', pos: 'n.', zh: '火山', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Gray ash from the volcano buried the rich fields under a thick blanket.', exZh: '火山喷出的灰色火山灰像厚毯一样掩埋了肥沃的田地。' },
  { w: 'destroy', p: '/dɪˈstrɔɪ/', pos: 'v.', zh: '破坏；摧毁；消灭', deck: 'senior', ex: 'One careless fire in summer can destroy the growth of fifty quiet years.', exZh: '夏天一场大意的火灾，能毁掉五十年静默生长的林木。' },
  { w: 'survive', p: '/sərˈvaɪv/', pos: 'v.', zh: '幸存；存活；比……活得久', deck: 'senior', ex: 'Only a few seeds survived the long rains and greened the field again.', exZh: '只有少数种子在那场长雨中存活，重新让田地变绿。' },
